# Content authoring — drafts / production / previews stay local.
# Scaffold files (schema.md, system-prompt.md, README.md, _template.html,
# _authoring-guide.md, _gemini-quickstart.md) remain tracked so collaborators
# and other LLMs can pick up the structure on a fresh clone.
docs/content-authoring/**/draft.md
docs/content-authoring/**/production.md
docs/content-authoring/**/preview.html

